[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2747660423","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104530#issuecomment-2747660423","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104530","id":2747660423,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jxfiH","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-24T10:38:25Z","updated_at":"2025-03-24T10:38:25Z","body":"To be honest, I don't see why you would _ever_ create a button without an associated action at all. In fact, this behavior has never been reported until now.\r\nLike, it can be documented, sure, but it probably should error at the moment of creation.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2747660423/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2748272319","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104530#issuecomment-2748272319","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104530","id":2748272319,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jz06_","user":{"login":"RedMser","id":5117197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTcxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5117197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-24T14:11:47Z","updated_at":"2025-03-24T14:11:47Z","body":"> I don't see why you would _ever_ create a button without an associated action at all.\r\n\r\nExactly, my mind while developing was \"I don't need to differentiate which button I've pressed in `custom_action` signal, since I only have a single one, so why bother specifying an action?\"... So the fact it didn't emit a signal felt like a bug to me, checked source code and found this if-check silently waiting for me.\r\n\r\n> it probably should error at the moment of creation\r\n\r\nWell, action is an optional parameter, so it is intentional that you can leave it out. Since the API returns a `Button`, it's probably so you can hook up the \"pressed\" signal yourself. No clue if anyone does this though.\r\n\r\nIMO the signal should always emit, even on the default empty string. But even that would be a breaking change in behavior.\r\nDocumentation change is still the least intrusive.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2748272319/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2986024129","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104530#issuecomment-2986024129","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104530","id":2986024129,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6x-xzB","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T23:30:16Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T23:30:16Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2986024129/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]